  "description": "AdvancedImageViewer.WinForms is a modern, high-performance replacement for the standard WinForms PictureBox. It provides hardware-accelerated smooth panning, scroll-wheel zoom (5% to 10000%), async image loading, caching, built-in themes (Cyberpunk, DashboardPremium, etc.), HUD overlays, and precise image-to-screen coordinate conversion for custom drawing.",
